 finalized."}},"isGameProper(address)":{"details":"Note that isGameProper previously checked that the game type was equal to the      respected game type. However, it should be noted that it is possible for a game other      than the respected game type to resolve without being invalidated. Since isGameProper      exists to determine if a game has (or has not) been invalidated, we now allow any game      type to be considered a proper game. We enforce checks on the game type in      isGameClaimValid().","params":{"_game":"The game to check."},"returns":{"_0":"Whether the game is a proper game."}},"isGameRegistered(address)":{"params":{"_game":"The game to check."},"returns":{"_0":"Whether the game is factory registered."}},"isGameResolved(address)":{"params":{"_game":"The game to check."},"returns":{"_0":"Whether the game is resolved."}},"isGameRespected(address)":{"params":{"_game":"The game to check."},"returns":{"_0":"Whether the game is of a respected game type."}},"isGameRetired(address)":{"params":{"_game":"The game to check."},"returns":{"_0":"Whether the game is retired."}},"respectedGameType()":{"returns":{"_0":"The respected game type."}},"setAnchorState(address)":{"params":{"_game":"New candidate anchor game."}}},"stateVariables":{"version":{"custom:semver":"2.2.2"}},"title":"AnchorStateRegistry","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"AnchorStateRegistry_AnchorGameBlacklisted()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the anchor root is requested, but the anchor game is blacklisted."}],"AnchorStateRegistry_InvalidAnchorGame()":[{"notice":"Thrown when an invalid anchor game is provided."}],"AnchorStateRegistry_Unauthorized()":[{"notice":"Thrown when an unauthorized caller attempts to set the anchor state."}]},"events":{"AnchorNotUpdated(address)":{"notice":"Emitted when an anchor state is not updated."},"AnchorUpdated(address)":{"notice":"Emitted when an anchor state is updated."}},"kind":"user","methods":{"anchorGame()":{"notice":"The game whose claim is currently being used as the anchor state."},"constructor":{"notice":"Constructor to disable initializers."},"disputeGameFactory()":{"notice":"Address of the DisputeGameFactory contract."},"getAnchorRoot()":{"notice":"Returns the current anchor root."},"initialize(address,address,address,(bytes32,uint256))":{"notice":"Initializes the contract."},"isGameBlacklisted(address)":{"notice":"Determines whether a game is blacklisted."},"isGameClaimValid(address)":{"notice":"Returns whether a game's root claim is valid."},"isGameFinalized(address)":{"notice":"Returns whether a game is finalized."},"isGameProper(address)":{"notice":"**READ THIS FUNCTION DOCUMENTATION CAREFULLY.**         Determines whether a game resolved properly and the game was not subject to any         invalidation conditions. The root claim of a proper game IS NOT guaranteed to be         valid. The root claim of a proper game CAN BE incorrect and still be a proper game.         DO NOT USE THIS FUNCTION ALONE TO DETERMINE IF A ROOT CLAIM IS VALID."},"isGameRegistered(address)":{"notice":"Determines whether a game is registered in the DisputeGameFactory."},"isGameResolved(address)":{"notice":"Returns whether a game is resolved."},"isGameRespected(address)":{"notice":"Determines whether a game is of a respected game type."},"isGameRetired(address)":{"notice":"Determines whether a game is retired."},"portal()":{"notice":"Address of the OptimismPortal contract."},"respectedGameType()":{"notice":"Returns the respected game type."},"setAnchorState(address)":{"notice":"Updates the anchor game."},"superchainConfig()":{"notice":"Address of the SuperchainConfig contract."},"version()":{"notice":"Semantic version."}},"notice":"The AnchorStateRegistry is a contract that stores the latest \"anchor\" state for each available         FaultDisputeGame type. The anchor state is the latest state that has been proposed on L1 and was not         challenged within the challenge period. By using stored anchor states, new FaultDisputeGame instanc